{"id":"8a6696125be20e0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md","title":"Poisson Random Measure","display":"df-poisson-random-measure — Poisson Random Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-poisson-random-measure","aliases":["58-df-poisson-random-measure","Poisson Random Measure"],"display":"df-poisson-random-measure — Poisson Random Measure","depends_on":["[[58-df-point-process]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-poisson-random-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-poisson-random-measure</span><span>Poisson Random Measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-poisson-random-measure — Poisson Random Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30a1cf9b20b2ebb1\" href=\"?note=30a1cf9b20b2ebb1\" title=\"58-df-point-process\">58-df-point-process</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\mathcal E,\\nu)\">\\((E,\\mathcal E,\\nu)\\)</span> (measured state space and intensity measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> (random counting-measure candidate; its typing is supplied by the point-process predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S\\)</span> (Poisson-point-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30a1cf9b20b2ebb1\" href=\"?note=30a1cf9b20b2ebb1\" title=\"58-df-point-process\">58-df-point-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S\\)</span> (Poisson random measure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}random\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}random\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}random\\text{-}measure\\text{-}moments} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land B\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\nu(B)&lt;\\infty\\to \\sum_{k\\in\\omega}k\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\Pi(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\bigr)=\\nu(B)\\land\\sum_{k\\in\\omega}(k-\\nu(B))^2\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\Pi(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\bigr)=\\nu(B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}random\\text{-}measure\\text{-}moments} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land B\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\nu(B)&lt;\\infty\\to \\sum_{k\\in\\omega}k\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\Pi(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\bigr)=\\nu(B)\\land\\sum_{k\\in\\omega}(k-\\nu(B))^2\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\Pi(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\bigr)=\\nu(B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Poisson random measure: a random counting measure whose finite-intensity counts are Poisson and whose counts on finite disjoint families are independent.</li>\n<li>Compensated integrals against <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde\\Pi=\\Pi-\\nu\">\\(\\widetilde\\Pi=\\Pi-\\nu\\)</span> yield martingales under the usual integrability hypotheses.</li>\n<li>Lévy-Itô: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_t = \\gamma t + \\sigma W_t + \\int_{|x|&lt;1} x \\tilde{\\Pi} + \\int_{|x| \\geq 1} x \\Pi\">\\(X_t = \\gamma t + \\sigma W_t + \\int_{|x|&lt;1} x \\tilde{\\Pi} + \\int_{|x| \\geq 1} x \\Pi\\)</span></li>\n<li>The mean and variance identities above are restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(B)&lt;\\infty\">\\(\\nu(B)&lt;\\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sato, Lévy Processes and Infinitely Divisible Distributions</li>\n<li>Applebaum, Lévy Processes and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-point-process","status":"resolved","id":"30a1cf9b20b2ebb1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-point-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-point-process","status":"resolved","id":"30a1cf9b20b2ebb1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S$ (Poisson-point-process predicate, see [[58-df-point-process]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"(E,\\mathcal E,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}random\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}random\\text{-}measure\\text{-}moments} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S(\\Pi,\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land B\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\nu(B)<\\infty\\to \\sum_{k\\in\\omega}k\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\Pi(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\bigr)=\\nu(B)\\land\\sum_{k\\in\\omega}(k-\\nu(B))^2\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:\\Pi(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\bigr)=\\nu(B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\widetilde\\Pi=\\Pi-\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"X_t = \\gamma t + \\sigma W_t + \\int_{|x|<1} x \\tilde{\\Pi} + \\int_{|x| \\geq 1} x \\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(B)<\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":2062,"backlinks":[{"id":"50ccecf2bfaccddf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-961","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md|58-df-poisson-random-measure]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["30a1cf9b20b2ebb1"]}